  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>It is almost impossible for foes to wriggle free from your grasp.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Improved Grapple or grab special attack.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your CMD against attempts to escape from your grapple is increased by an amount equal to your mythic tier, whether such attempts are made as a grapple combat maneuver or an Escape Artist skill check. In addition, you can grapple creatures using freedom of movement, though you take a base -20 penalty on combat maneuver checks made to grapple such a target. This penalty is reduced by an amount equal to your mythic tier (if your target is a mythic creature or is using mythic freedom of movement) or by twice your mythic tier otherwise.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc193\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
